OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost showers
OL,6,Fwill fade allowing clear spells to
OL,7,Fdevelop. A few showers will persist
OL,8,Faround exposed coasts. It will become
OL,9,Frather chilly overnight, especially in
OL,10,Frural areas, with a few mist and fog
OL,11,Fpatches forming by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FTurning increasingly cloudy
OL,14,Facross northern Scotland, with some
OL,15,Flight and patchy rain possible.
OL,16,FElsewhere coastal showers will ease,
OL,17,Fleaving most areas dry with sunny
OL,18,Fspells. Temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
